import{_ as t,o,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 938 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 4 | Full-Level Openness of the Great Dao","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 938 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 4 | Full-Level Openness of the Great Dao","no":938,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 4","Dao Openness","Knowledge Monopoly","Anti-Predation"],"related":["18-Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism","08-Every-Road-Available Guarantee System","907-300 Systems Full Openness"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0938_模块5-规则四-大道全层级公开.md","filePath":"en/0938_模块5-规则四-大道全层级公开.md"}'),i={name:"en/0938_模块5-规则四-大道全层级公开.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,d,h){return o(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-938-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-4-full-level-openness-of-the-great-dao" tabindex="-1">Entry 938 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 4 | Full-Level Openness of the Great Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-938-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-4-full-level-openness-of-the-great-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 938 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 4 | Full-Level Openness of the Great Dao&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 18, 08 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-dao-may-not-be-privately-owned-private-ownership-is-predation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the Dao may not be privately owned; private ownership is predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-dao-may-not-be-privately-owned-private-ownership-is-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the Dao may not be privately owned; private ownership is predation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old cosmos&#39;s most insidious predation is not grabbing money or land, but &quot;monopolizing the Dao.&quot; A sect locks core cultivation methods in its scripture pavilion, transmitting only to direct line; a forbidden zone hides the highest laws in a forbidden ground, and outsiders who peek die. Knowledge monopoly lets the weak not even see what &quot;the road to strength looks like,&quot; so they can only work for the strong generation after generation. Heavenly-Dao Rule 4 must de-name this monopoly at the cosmic-law layer: the Great Dao, from Sense-Condensed Realm introductory breathing to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s ultimate laws, is open at every level, in every lineage, with no threshold.</p><p>The six top-level axioms run through it: the anti-predation axiom directly requires &quot;Great Dao full-level openness, no private hoarding no monopoly&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races makes openness the equal admission ticket for Myriad Ranks 99%; the collective-ascension axiom makes the open Great Dao grow ever clearer through network-wide sharing; the causal self-discipline axiom requires openness itself not trap-clause causality-disturbing methods; the law-first axiom lets &quot;openness&quot;&#39;s levels, versions, and errata be uniformly managed by the law network, never lost and never privately tampered.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-four-layer-openness-standard" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Four-Layer Openness Standard <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-four-layer-openness-standard" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Four-Layer Openness Standard&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Rule 4 stipulates all cultivation knowledge must satisfy:</p><ol><li><strong>Full-level openness</strong>: from Sense-Condensed Realm initiation through Origin Realm, Multiverse Realm, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, every level&#39;s Dharma doors are open, with no hidden layer &quot;only transmitted to a few prodigies&quot;;</li><li><strong>Full-lineage openness</strong>: the five lineages&#39; (human, alien beast, plant spirit, mechanical construct, consciousness-information) adapted methods are all open, with no wall by clan;</li><li><strong>Full-version openness</strong>: a method&#39;s revision history, errata records, and failure cases are all public, not only the &quot;success version&quot;;</li><li><strong>Zero-threshold openness</strong>: open channels are free and barrier-free, with no wealth, bloodline, status, or contribution-point prerequisite to reading.</li></ol><p>The 300 Origin Cultivation Systems (Document 10) have all been launched onto the Alaya Network public library per this standard.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis-why-the-great-dao-must-be-open" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis: Why the Great Dao Must Be Open <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis-why-the-great-dao-must-be-open" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis: Why the Great Dao Must Be Open&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Every-road argument</strong>: the Every-Road-Available Guarantee System (Document 08) points out evolutionary right is a basic right, and &quot;not knowing where the road lies&quot; is the greatest deprivation;</li><li><strong>Multiplication argument</strong>: one Dao cultivated by one person has finite use; one Dao cultivated by ten thousand people, with Multiplication-Fruit hundredfold deduction amplification superimposed, the Dao itself becomes more perfect under ten-thousand-fold verification — openness actually makes the Dao stronger;</li><li><strong>Anti-monopoly argument</strong>: once knowledge is privately hoarded, its holder sets himself up as &quot;Dao lord,&quot; forming hidden rule over Myriad Ranks; this is the knowledge source of class solidification (Rule 19).</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network public library sets a &quot;Great-Dao open interface,&quot; which all beings may access by soul imprint, no application needed;</li><li>The Anchor Council sets a &quot;Dao-Version Committee&quot; that uniformly erratas, archives, and tags extended settings &quot;pending terminology-committee calibration&quot;;</li><li>Holders of privately hoarded Dao must complete surrender registration within a time limit; those not surrendering after deadline have their privately hoarded Dao automatically &quot;unlocked and opened&quot; in the network;</li><li>Openness is not coercion: cultivators may create secret methods, but once a secret method touches common law nodes, its core principles must be traceable and auditable.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: inadvertently retaining &quot;oral master transmission&quot; not open, make up submission within a time limit, no liability pursued;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: deliberately privately hoarding, walling and charging, controlling disciples with &quot;untransmittable secrets,&quot; has law-anchor permissions frozen and enters the conversion program;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: monopolizing some main Dao, using it to coerce Myriad Ranks, creating dependence that &quot;without me the Dao cannot be walked,&quot; is downgraded per Entry 963&#39;s civilizational-weight assessment and stripped of high-level access.</li></ul><p>Sanction logic: let the private hoarder go from &quot;Dao lord&quot; back to &quot;Dao seeker,&quot; again standing before the open library studying with everyone.</p><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision automatically compares the &quot;existing Dao library&quot; with the &quot;known law-node map,&quot; discovering private hoarding and alerting as the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee checks and receives private-hoard registrations as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates monopoly cases as the third layer; Myriad Ranks&#39; cultural-education autonomous groups supervise openness quality (whether hidden, whether mined) as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: one Dao verified by ten thousand, avoiding countless people repeating trial and error in the dark</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: knowledge monopoly is predation&#39;s highest form; Rule 4 directly tears down the wall; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type peerless academies pick people via &quot;gifted slots,&quot; and most cannot even touch the door; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s public library is open to 99% with zero threshold</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the five lineages, Youth Supremes, and planet consciousness all have adapted open Dao texts, not favoring the human race alone</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: when new planes are incorporated, their native Dao texts enter the library simultaneously; cross-civilization Dao cross-verify, and the worldview may expand infinitely</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Great Dao is not some sect&#39;s private property, but the cosmic public heritage for all Dao seekers. Rule 4 tears down the scripture pavilion&#39;s walls; only then do Myriad Ranks stand for the first time on the same starting line.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/18-修炼资源开放机制.html">Entry 18 · Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Every-Road-Available Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/907_模块5-第六条-三百套体系全开放.html">Entry 907 · 300 Systems Full Openness</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/939_模块5-规则五-无私藏无垄断.html">Entry 939 · Rule 5 No Private Hoarding No Monopoly</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const m=t(i,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
